    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with his consent, prompted by the discussion of SUDEP earlier in the year. He named a health care agent, a friend, and completed a health care power of attorney form; the agent is recorded in the chart and is not named here. He wants his agent and his neurologist to be told if he has prolonged or repeated seizures, and he wants to be asked directly about any treatment that could affect his ability to write. He chose not to record specific treatment preferences today. The plan will be revisited yearly or after any serious illness. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
